            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Shinkon",
            "review_text": "Eddie R\n43 contributions\n0\nBest omakase sushi in Saigon.\nSep 2025 • Couples\nOmakase only sushi. 2.5, 3.5 or 5mm VND for the premium fish. Chef Tony was professional and explained what every fish was and how to eat as the night grew long. Everything was delicious. We enjoyed a bottle of Kubota sake “black” with dinner, (600kVND). I’m total dinner was about $350USD.\nWritten September 19, 2025",
