            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Shinkon",
            "review_text": "Vee Dinh\nLos Angeles, California184 contributions\n0\nOmakase in the heart of Saigon\nJan 2024 • Friends\nThis omakase restaurant is located in the heart of Saigon. Dishes are very fresh and yummy. Premium ingredients are used in their different omakase sets. \n\nSushi chefs are very friendly and knowledgable in explaining the dishes. I also love the bright interior design of this place.\nWritten March 20, 2024",
