            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Shinkon",
            "review_text": "Huy N\n6 contributions\n0\nExceptional\nDec 2022\nWe had one of the most beautiful omakase experience at Shinkon last week. The quality and selection of fish was phenomenal. The dishes are beautifully, meticulously prepared by chef Linh, who are not only very experienced but also a very good host. We also surprised by the exceptional, high quality Sake and also good list of Japanese wine that are very fascinating & well paired with the food.\n\nI am certain that anyone who appreciates quality omakase will be blown away by the experience at Shinkon\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 7, 2023",
